<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY FIVE WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY FIVE WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA, South Africa 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Zimbabwe by five wickets in the triangular tournament match at Centurion Park on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 211 all out (48.5 overs). South Africa 212 for five (46.1).</p>
</text>
